# Store & API Rules

## RTK Query APIs
- One API slice per domain in `store/api/` (e.g. `businessAuthApi`, `businessMainApi`)
- Typed payloads: import from `store/types/business/api_requests_data/`
- Typed responses: import from `store/types/business/api_responses/`
- Register reducer + middleware in `store/index.ts` and `store/rootReducer.ts`

```ts
// ✅ Typed endpoint
businessSignin: builder.mutation<ISignInResponse, SignInPayload>({
  query: (body) => ({ url: 'user/auth/signin', method: 'POST', body }),
}),
```

## Auth headers
- Read `auth_token` / `tempToken` from `business` slice in `prepareHeaders`
- Hash-signed endpoints: use `baseQueryWithHash` + `createHash` + `HeaderKeys`

## Selectors & slices
- Selectors in `store/selectors/` — use in components via `useAppSelector(useBusinessDetails)`
- Slice actions: import from `@/store/slices/business/businessSlice`
- Persisted slices: `business`, `config` only

## Error handling
- Use `handleLogout` from `store/utils/errorHandler` for auth failures
- Invalidate tags in `onQueryStarted` after successful mutations

## Hooks in components
```ts
const [signIn, { isLoading }] = useBusinessSigninMutation();
const businessData = useAppSelector(useBusinessDetails);
const dispatch = useAppDispatch();
```
